  "description": "NAQNUO crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I 41 c d. Reported CIF formula moiety: C42 H98 O15 Tb4 Ti1. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Ti1 (Ti) has 5 O neighbors; Tb1I (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2I (Tb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.410-5.190 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 84.65-164.81°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [(Tb0.9Er0.1)4Ti(μ5-O)(μ3-OiPr)2(μ2-OiPr)6(OiPr)6]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ5-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 6 OiPr (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies I(II), I(II).",
